    ("c:lever-anonymous", "If design polls were anonymous, the standing part of an Against vote's cost would shrink for voters who do not speak against the proposal. The chair could no longer ask Against voters for reasons, and the model predicts more Against votes on colleagues' proposals.", "split in two"),
